# Testing

## Client unit tests (`*.spec.js`)

- Framework: Karma + Mocha + Chai + Sinon
- Colocate specs next to source (e.g. `main.controller.spec.js`)
- Mock `$http`, ui-router, and services via Angular DI
- Run: `npm test` (delegates to `grunt test`)

## Server tests

- Unit specs: `server/api/*/*.spec.js` (Mocha)
- Integration tests: `server/api/*/*.integration.js` (Supertest against Express app)
- Use `mocha.conf.js` and Grunt `mochaTest` / `mocha_istanbul` tasks

## Guidelines

- Match existing assertion style (Chai `expect`, Sinon stubs/spies).
- Only add tests when requested or when covering non-trivial new behavior.
- Do not introduce Jest, Vitest, or other test runners.
